      {
        "id": 255717,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-12-06T17:06:48.799Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think it’s just people here regularly mix up their own tastes with what’s popular.</p>\n<p>I get and respect that people don’t always like the new things (as I’m not always into them either), but many of those things <em>are</em> just as popular as the EE stuff was. You have to acknowledge the latter while discussing the former.</p>",
