      {
        "id": 255720,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-12-06T17:15:42.737Z",
        "cooked": "<p>OK, that makes more sense, thank you for clearing it up.</p>\n<p>Yeah, there’s a <em>lot</em> of weird stuff in RL comics. If anything, Sentinels is often tame in that regard even with the newer additions.</p>\n<p>The RL Sentinels fandom is also much tamer than the average RL comics fandom (especially where shipping is concerned in particular).</p>",
