        "created_at": "2026-02-10T13:41:12.648Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That thing about Hook and Viggo Mortensen would have made a great segue to “Speaking of stories going wrong, here’s Grimm!”</p>\n<p>The chocolate Visionary metaphor amused me.  White Visionary is just Muse, right?</p>\n<p>I could have sworn that back in the Headless Horseman story, they had specifically said the Grimm Lord of the Harvest story didn’t have Rambler in it?</p>",
